C:      reference/svt-av1 @ 3115c0c1 — the PREBUILT oracle in the primary
        r7900x checkout (`Bin/Release/libSvtAv1Enc.a` 2026-08-31,
        `tools/perf_c_encode/perf_c_encode` 2026-09-03), NOT rebuilt.
port:   `env -u RUSTFLAGS cargo build --release -p zenav1-svt --example
        perf_encode --example identity_run -j 4` (no target-cpu=native).
tools:  Ir + counts: tools/perf_profile/callcount_cells.sh, callcount.py,
